= Peacock

== Installation

  $ go install github.com/davidfung/peacock@latest

== Probe

A probe is a piece of code that scan an object of interest and report anything
interesting.

It provides a Load() function to load the probe.  The Load() function takes one
argument of type write-only channel of string.  It returns nothing.

The probes are not packaged inside an "internal" folder because although they
are not supposed to be used standalone, there is no technical reason to make
them internal to the project.

=== A list of potential probes

* alive
* motd
* ip - change
* dns - change
* WiFi - change (new * gone)


